# Release notes

## 🆕 Features

- feat: ed2k protocol support (important!!!) @monkeyWie (#1316)

## 🐛 Bug Fixes

- fix: non-range HTTP downloaded bytes exceeding total file size @monkeyWie (#1317)
- fix: update isCreate logic for pending tasks @Roxym3 (#1314)
- fix: update RPM icon path @monkeyWie (#1309)

## 📖 Document

- docs: migrate docs.gopeed.com links to gopeed.com/docs equivalents @copilot-swe-agent (#1311)

## 🌎 Internationalization

- feat(lang): Catalan language added @kayron8 (#1303)
- feat(lang): update Turkish translation @Hweord (#1304)

# 更新日志

## 🆕 新特性

- feat: ed2k 协议支持 (重大特性！！！) @monkeyWie (#1316)

